{{!-- Brazilian Portuguese shell. `documentLang="pt"` is the BCP-47 tag for the
     document; `locale="br"` is the theme's content-locale key, matching the /br/
     collection in routes.yaml and the `locale` argument the layouts already take.
     Keeping them separate is why <html lang> is `pt` and not the invalid `br`. --}}
{{> "shell" documentLang="pt" locale="br"}}
